<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<!--
  Entitlements for AI Usage.app direct distribution (ci 02 Plan §2).
  No App Sandbox — the app spawns subprocesses (claude, swiftc) and reads
  Keychain items it creates at runtime, both incompatible with sandbox.
  The same file is used for ad-hoc (AC0) and Developer ID (AC2) builds so
  the keychain default access group stays stable across dev and release
  (ci 02 Risks §8).
-->
